Z||000008||Greg Piet||01-05-2001||08:05 PM||||OK found a place to quickly do a little testing.<BR>ROUGHLY..<BR>Stock 85 suspension w monroe shocks/struts and a rear sway bar running cold YOKO S306 at  29-32 psi<P>consistently .83 lat g's <BR>got a peak of .91 lat g's (I think this is in error as I likely went over a bump or something)... stay tuned next week for the after springs results.||||reg||1
